{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead World is a first-person shooter game created by a single person which is set in a post-apocalyptic Argentina that is divided into several stories in different times and locations of the country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story 1: THE LOST WAGON</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/extras/5aac99853aaa7a0a1a30d1134e3f5231.avif?t=1761405737\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/extras_big/5aac99853aaa7a0a1a30d1134e3f5231.avif?t=1761405737 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miguel receives a job that will take him to Rosario to see what happened to a wagon that was supposed to arrive at the Entre R\u00edos settlement of San Diego. But what was supposed to be a short trip turns into a struggle to get back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story 2: GINO'S JOURNEY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/extras/9843a42932594f8a87ea1fd6fcda25a1.avif?t=1761405737\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/extras_big/9843a42932594f8a87ea1fd6fcda25a1.avif?t=1761405737 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through the volcanic dunes of La Payunia... in a Renault 12.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a post-apocalyptic world where life has almost disappeared, Gino, a schnauzer from Mendoza, is the last of his kind. But everything changes when he learns that a female of his breed has been spotted in a distant settlement. Daniel and Manuel embark on a desperate journey through the dead world aboard their trusty Renault 12, facing mutants, hostile gangs, and whatever else crosses their path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAIN FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Diversity:</strong> Experience different narratives that explore the diverse facets of the Dead World.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Exploration:</strong> Traverse detailed environments in search of resources vital to your survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Combat:</strong> Face off against mutants and bandits using a wide variety of weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Mode:</strong> Test your skills in &quot;A Rogue's Tale,&quot; where survival depends on your decisions and skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> 1VS1 Mode: </strong>Face another player in 1VS1 mode and prove to be the most badass in the dead world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in Dead World and see if you can survive in a world where every step could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/extras/1177b9cb83cadedfc8743bca66328c6c.avif?t=1761405737\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/extras_big/1177b9cb83cadedfc8743bca66328c6c.avif?t=1761405737 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The lost wagon Act 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1376960/3f63358406d9a9670607cca935687d90725191fc.jpg"},{"name":"No windows","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1376960/d8926517c0d16974091e625b8a1110cb552793ba.jpg"},{"name":"Oid mortales...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1376960/b65c84f598eb1267f4a90b32d21bcce8426cfbd4.jpg"},{"name":"Hornero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/13