 FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Diversity:</strong> Experience different narratives that explore the diverse facets of the Dead World.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Exploration:</strong> Traverse detailed environments in search of resources vital to your survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Combat:</strong> Face off against mutants and bandits using a wide variety of weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Mode:</strong> Test your skills in &quot;A Rogue's Tale,&quot; where survival depends on your decisions and skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> 1VS1 Mode: </strong>Face another player in 1VS1 mode and prove to be the most badass in the dead world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in Dead World and see if you can survive in a world where every step could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/extras/1177b9cb83cadedfc8743bca66328c6c.avif?t=1761405737\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/extras_big/1177b9cb83cadedfc8743bca66328c6c.avif?t=1761405737 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p>","developers":["Milanesa Studio"],"dlc":[3920500],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/7d53a76de1bdc11f80aa64b781417af62c07f9f0/header.jpg?t=1761405737","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirement